        {
            "title": "〈熱門股〉低軌衛星與太空軍商機引爆 耀登谷底翻周漲逾21%登百元大關",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">受惠於SpaceX星艦第14次飛行測試在即與美國太空軍首度證實在軌部署武器等太空國防題材催化，射頻天線與通訊模組大廠耀登(3138-TW)本周股價強勁，18日收108元，周漲21.3%，周成交量5975張。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">耀登今年大幅提升研發投入，預估全年研發費用占營收比重將達16%至17%，改寫近3至5年以來新高紀錄。耀登研發重點鎖定低軌衛星終端設備的機構設計與散熱技術，並於竹北增設天線研發據點，且已於今年3月取得國家太空中心Ka頻段標案並於下半年陸續交付，同時持續與美系低軌衛星營運商及中小型客戶洽談合作，相關專案有望在今年第3季與第4季更加明朗。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-6fae360a-6833-3419-a386-4919e5ffa769-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在產能布局與射頻天線本業方面，耀登越南新廠預定於今年第3季正式投產，初期設置3條產線，未來可進一步擴充至18條，整體產能預期將大幅提升5至6倍，主力鎖定非紅供應鏈的轉單與新訂單需求。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在筆電天線領域，耀登受惠美系客戶供應占比持續提升，躍居主要供應商之一，並成功切入兩家新品牌客戶共同開發新案，加上量測設備代理與認證服務拓展至衛星地面收發設備，為整體營運增添多元柴火。</p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"耀登日K線圖\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"828\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/600fa61b37195690ed6b008d67a9a9402cb23aaa132ce430e7680d31a843c171/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fbb7999eb4d75b5d867170660944c482a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">耀登日K線圖</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"read-more-vendor mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><span>更多鉅亨報導</span><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"〈焦點股〉低軌衛星法規鬆綁與SpaceX上市雙利多 耀登、啟碁強攻漲停\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:〈焦點股〉低軌衛星法規鬆綁與SpaceX上市雙利多 耀登、啟碁強攻漲停;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6461966?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">〈焦點股〉低軌衛星法規鬆綁與SpaceX上市雙利多 耀登、啟碁強攻漲停</a><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"耀登4月營收1.69億元月年雙增 越南新廠預計年中完工\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:耀登4月營收1.69億元月年雙增 越南新廠預計年中完工;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6449922?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">耀登4月營收1.69億元月年雙增 越南新廠預計年中完工</a></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%86%B1%E9%96%80%E8%82%A1-%E4%BD%8E%E8%BB%8C%E8%A1%9B%E6%98%9F%E8%88%87%E5%A4%AA%E7%A9%BA%E8%BB%8D%E5%95%86%E6%A9%9F%E5%BC%95%E7%88%86-%E8%80%80%E7%99%BB%E8%B0%B7%E5%BA%95%E7%BF%BB%E5%91%A8%E6%BC%B2%E9%80%BE21-%E7%99%BB%E7%99%BE%E5%85%83%E5%A4%A7%E9%97%9C-002947777.html",
